                %annotation{:encoding => "application/x-tex"} v_p:\mathbf{Z}_p\to \mathbf{Z}\cup\{\infty\}
            called the
            %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/p-adic+valuation"} p-adic valuation
