                  %mrow
                    %mi x
                  %annotation{:encoding => "application/x-tex"} x
            %math.maruku-mathml{:display => "inline", :xmlns => "http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"}
              %semantics
                %mrow
                  %msub
                    %mi v
                    %mi p
                  %mo{:stretchy => "false"} (
                  %mn 0
                  %mo{:stretchy => "false"} )
                  %mo =
                  %mn ∞
                %annotation{:encoding => "application/x-tex"} v_p(0)=\infty
            as required by the axioms of valuation. The
            %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/norm"} norm
            induced by the valuation is (up to equivalence) given by
            = succeed "," do
              %math.maruku-mathml{:display => "inline", :xmlns => "http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"}
