                  %msub
                    %mstyle{:mathvariant => "bold"}
                      %mi Q
                    %mi p
                %annotation{:encoding => "application/x-tex"} \mathbf{Q}_p
            is the
            %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/field+of+fractions"} field of fractions
            of the
            %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/p-adic+integers"} p-adic integers
            = succeed "." do
              %math.maruku-mathml{:display => "inline", :xmlns => "http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"}
